WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.969
-You guys, whenever I get
some downtime here at the show,

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:04.870
I like to go on Instagram and
scroll through all the photos.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.872
And one thing I've noticed
is that a lot of times,

00:00:06.872 --> 00:00:09.275
two people will write
the exact same caption,

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.844
but the pictures they post
will be completely different.

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:13.746
I'm gonna show you what I mean
in this next segment.

00:00:13.746 --> 00:00:15.748
It's time for "Picture This."

00:00:15.748 --> 00:00:18.384
-♪ Picture this, picture this,
picture this ♪

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.420
♪ Yeah, picture this ♪

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.654
[ Applause ]

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.289
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:25.024
A lot of energy in that song.

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:26.492
It's just nothing but.

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:28.294
Like, "Vooooh!"

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:31.798
-♪ Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh ♪

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:33.466
♪ Picture this ♪

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:35.368
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:38.003
Alright, let's take a look
at this first example.

00:00:38.003 --> 00:00:41.141 line:60%
Arnold Schwarzenegger
and Jared Kushner both wrote,

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:42.842 line:64%
"This makes my blood boil."

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:45.778 line:60%
Arnold Schwarzenegger posted
a picture of the Capitol riot.

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:48.414 line:60%
Jared Kushner posted
a picture of garlic.

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:51.917
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:51.917 --> 00:00:55.722
This next one is
from Disney+ and CBS.

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:58.691 line:60%
They both wrote, "Get ready
to enter a trippy new world."

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.527 line:64%
Disney+ posted a picture

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:02.462 line:60%
of the new Marvel series,
"WandaVision."

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:04.930 line:60%
CBS posted
a picture of Theraflu.

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:07.400 line:60%
Oh, yeah, that's real deal.
[ Applause ]

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.169
That stuff is real deal.

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:11.671
Here's one from Tom Brady
and Rob Gronkowski.

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:13.873 line:60%
They both wrote,
"You're my other half."

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:16.609 line:60%
Tom Brady posted
a picture of Gisele.

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:19.345 line:60%
Rob Gronkowski posted
a picture of his legs.

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:22.615 line:60%
[ Laughter ]
Well, it is -- He's right.

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:24.250
It is his other...

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:27.921
This next one is from
Ben &amp; Jerry's and Rudy Giuliani.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:30.323 line:60%
They both wrote,
"Don't tempt me."

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:32.759 line:60%
Ben &amp; Jerry's posted
a picture of a dog

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:35.528 line:60%
