dog-treat ice cream.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.830 line:60%
Rudy Giuliani posted
a picture of himself

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:40.533 line:60%
staring at the new Ben &amp; Jerry's
dog-treat ice cream.

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:42.534
[ Laughter and applause ]
Hmm.

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:45.338
♪ Picture this ♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:47.005
Do it one more time?
